1
00:00:04,940 --> 00:00:07,060
You're a Poisoner, Dio Brando.

2
00:00:07,260 --> 00:00:09,966
I have all the proof I
require, and then some!

3
00:00:14,040 --> 00:00:16,877
He's found his proof, so be it.

4
00:00:16,960 --> 00:00:19,857
This moment's been a
long time coming, JoJo.

5
00:00:19,940 --> 00:00:22,880
Now, I finish what I started!

6
00:00:35,320 --> 00:00:36,740
Let's go.

7
00:01:25,380 --> 00:01:26,757
Well, I'm one of the most
important things that I saw before.

8
00:01:26,840 --> 00:01:30,297
I'm an image that goes through the
world of the power of the people.

9
00:01:30,380 --> 00:01:32,137
I will not be able to pass

10
00:01:32,220 --> 00:01:38,100
the world over to the dead.

11
00:01:43,400 --> 00:01:45,077
I will not be able to pass

12
00:01:45,160 --> 00:01:50,620
the world over to the dead.

13
00:01:59,000 --> 00:02:01,020
I tracked down the antidote.

14
00:02:01,940 --> 00:02:03,660
Father took it moments ago.

15
00:02:05,840 --> 00:02:08,020
Dio, this pains me greatly.

16
00:02:08,460 --> 00:02:12,877
For years, you were my brother, and now
I have no recourse but to turn you in.

17
00:02:12,960 --> 00:02:13,820
I'm sorry.

18
00:02:14,160 --> 00:02:18,880
Really, I'm sure you don't believe a word
of it, but I'm telling you the truth.

19
00:02:21,320 --> 00:02:23,620
Even now, you show compassion.

20
00:02:26,820 --> 00:02:30,660
Jojo, I've been a devil,
but grant me this one wish.

21
00:02:31,300 --> 00:02:35,880
Allow me to do the right thing for
once in my life and turn myself in.

22
00:02:36,780 --> 00:02:37,610
What's this?

23
00:02:38,000 --> 00:02:42,941
I thought once I confronted him, he'd fight
me tooth and nail like a cornered beast.

24
00:02:44,600 --> 00:02:47,697
Jojo, you should be dead
in a gutter right now.

25
00:02:47,780 --> 00:02:52,074
I must distract him long enough for
the knife and mask to find their mark

26
00:02:52,460 --> 00:02:54,340
My wicked deeds gnaw at me.

27
00:02:54,500 --> 00:02:57,057
The poverty I knew as
a child ate away at my

28
00:02:57,140 --> 00:02:59,905
moral compass until greed
was all that remained

29
00:03:00,340 --> 00:03:01,869
I'm the lowest of the low.

30
00:03:02,040 --> 00:03:03,877
Your father took me in off the street,

31
00:03:03,960 --> 00:03:08,417
and I repaid his kindness with poison
The only reason I came back was to

32
00:03:08,500 --> 00:03:13,420
surrender myself If I'd wanted to flee you
never would have laid eyes on me again.

33
00:03:13,620 --> 00:03:14,900
I see your point

34
00:03:15,480 --> 00:03:17,680
Please allow me to make amends.

35
00:03:18,400 --> 00:03:19,230
Deal.

36
00:03:19,313 --> 00:03:20,628
Look alive, Master Joestar.

37
00:03:21,000 --> 00:03:23,412
He's trying to lure you in like he's not.

38
00:03:24,300 --> 00:03:27,277
Right about now, you're
probably wondering who I am.

39
00:03:27,360 --> 00:03:28,889
Allow me to elucidate you.

40
00:03:29,240 --> 00:03:31,920
The name is Robert E .O. Speedwagon.

41
00:03:32,160 --> 00:03:35,297
I had a hunch Jonathan's run
of trouble might not be done,

42
00:03:35,380 --> 00:03:37,027
so I followed him back home.

43
00:03:37,160 --> 00:03:41,477
I like you, Jonathan, so I'm going to
offer up this little tidbit pro bono.

44
00:03:41,560 --> 00:03:42,920
Living in the gutter,

45
00:03:43,100 --> 00:03:46,797
you learn to spot lowlights pretty
quick if you want to see tomorrow.

46
00:03:46,880 --> 00:03:51,217
I've trained my nose to sort out the bad
ones from the good just from a sniff.

47
00:03:51,300 --> 00:03:56,160
This fella reeks of brimstone and blood
worse than anyone I've ever laid eyes on.

48
00:03:56,500 --> 00:04:00,040
He is pure evil, right
down to his very bones.

49
00:04:00,580 --> 00:04:03,217
Is he a victim of
circumstance, you're wondering?

50
00:04:03,300 --> 00:04:04,360
Not on your life!

51
00:04:04,600 --> 00:04:07,306
He's been evil since he
drew his first breath.

52
00:04:08,940 --> 00:04:13,360
But don't you fret, because I
brought you a friend, and never him!

53
00:04:15,280 --> 00:04:19,045
This man confessed to selling you
the poison you used on Father.

54
00:04:20,460 --> 00:04:21,580
I've heard enough.

55
00:04:23,400 --> 00:04:24,840
You break my heart.

56
00:04:26,440 --> 00:04:31,500
Why, dear, from the day you arrived, I have
loved you as though you were my own son.

57
00:04:33,840 --> 00:04:35,957
Father, you're too weak to be down here.

58
00:04:36,040 --> 00:04:36,870
You're right.

59
00:04:37,180 --> 00:04:38,900
I'll return to my chamber.

60
00:04:40,320 --> 00:04:42,680
I don't want to see my boy in chains.

61
00:04:43,220 --> 00:04:46,000
Do what you must, Jojo. I will.

62
00:04:47,060 --> 00:04:49,000
Is this how it all ends?

63
00:04:49,300 --> 00:04:52,180
He won't see the inside
of a cell this night.

64
00:04:52,540 --> 00:04:56,100
I read his face and the
trio of moors on his ear.

65
00:04:56,400 --> 00:04:59,660
The devil smiles on him
and grants him luck.

66
00:05:02,740 --> 00:05:08,420
Jojo, I want you to be the one to
put the cuffs on me Please, brother

67
00:05:09,060 --> 00:05:09,940
All right

68
00:05:11,700 --> 00:05:12,720
Be careful,

69
00:05:12,980 --> 00:05:18,620
he's a crafty one Jojo, it was hubris
that led me to this ignominious end

70
00:05:20,080 --> 00:05:22,700
This fall from grace has taught me well

71
00:05:23,280 --> 00:05:27,077
However one may scheme
and assemble My downfall

72
00:05:27,160 --> 00:05:29,572
this night is part of the human condition

73
00:05:29,820 --> 00:05:32,500
a condition I now forsake.

74
00:05:32,680 --> 00:05:34,620
Wait, forsake? What do you mean?

75
00:05:34,840 --> 00:05:38,840
You see, I am about to
become so much more!

76
00:05:40,200 --> 00:05:42,420
Help me shed this mortal skin!

77
00:05:42,840 --> 00:05:44,420
Mother's mask? But how?

78
00:05:44,780 --> 00:05:45,700
Watch out!

79
00:05:45,980 --> 00:05:47,100
Fire at will, man!

80
00:05:47,220 --> 00:05:49,260
Jojo, your blood is the key!

81
00:05:55,180 --> 00:05:56,777
Oh my god!

82
00:05:56,860 --> 00:05:58,360
FOLDER!

83
00:06:09,860 --> 00:06:11,340
Shoot that maniac!

84
00:06:28,180 --> 00:06:29,010
Jojo...

85
00:06:31,100 --> 00:06:31,930
Father...

86
00:06:32,680 --> 00:06:34,200
This is all my fault.

87
00:06:34,440 --> 00:06:36,322
I should have blocked his knife.

88
00:06:36,640 --> 00:06:39,500
The mosque, when I saw it, I froze up.

89
00:06:40,060 --> 00:06:41,720
And you paid the price.

90
00:06:45,240 --> 00:06:46,420
Take this ring.

91
00:06:48,020 --> 00:06:50,000
It was your mother's, Jojo.

92
00:06:51,760 --> 00:06:52,590
Father...

93
00:06:53,020 --> 00:06:53,850
Damn it!

94
00:06:54,120 --> 00:06:55,937
Ain't a doctor on earth who can fix that.

95
00:06:56,020 --> 00:06:58,160
How'd that devil get the drop on us?

96
00:06:58,280 --> 00:06:59,337
It's all my fault.

97
00:06:59,420 --> 00:07:02,126
If only I hadn't listened
to you, Sir Joestar.

98
00:07:03,240 --> 00:07:07,157
If I had run his father out of town
years ago like I'd have mind to,

99
00:07:07,240 --> 00:07:10,880
none of this would have taken
place. Hold on. Whose father?

100
00:07:11,920 --> 00:07:13,979
Back when I first joined the Force,

101
00:07:14,180 --> 00:07:16,277
there was a ne 'er-do-well
who tried to pawn

102
00:07:16,360 --> 00:07:19,280
that very ring you now
see on Joestar's finger.

103
00:07:20,020 --> 00:07:23,900
The suspect was Dio's
birth father, Dario Brando.

104
00:07:26,020 --> 00:07:28,138
It's mine, of that there's no doubt.

105
00:07:28,280 --> 00:07:32,040
My late wife and I had them
made to celebrate our betrothal.

106
00:07:32,400 --> 00:07:36,580
A local cut purse by the name of
Dario Brando was trying to sell it.

107
00:07:38,020 --> 00:07:39,180
Can it be?

108
00:07:40,020 --> 00:07:44,500
Sir Joestar thought he owed his life
to Dario, but he was sadly mistaken.

109
00:07:45,360 --> 00:07:47,737
Dario hadn't scrambled down to the mangled

110
00:07:47,820 --> 00:07:50,377
carriage that fateful night
to look for survivors,

111
00:07:50,460 --> 00:07:52,560
but to root for ill-gotten riches.

112
00:07:54,220 --> 00:07:55,560
You stay back!

113
00:07:56,860 --> 00:07:59,360
This man, what has he said, Inspector?

114
00:07:59,920 --> 00:08:02,626
Did he ever tell you
that I gave him the ring?

115
00:08:02,740 --> 00:08:04,540
Aye, he swore up and down.

116
00:08:04,800 --> 00:08:05,900
You filthy liar.

117
00:08:06,200 --> 00:08:07,900
He swore with good reason.

118
00:08:08,260 --> 00:08:10,613
I gave him the ring just as he told you.

119
00:08:10,700 --> 00:08:12,288
You have got to be kidding.

120
00:08:13,520 --> 00:08:14,600
He is innocent.

121
00:08:15,160 --> 00:08:17,120
Let him go at once, Inspector.

122
00:08:17,600 --> 00:08:19,840
But, sir, this man stole from you.

123
00:08:20,060 --> 00:08:24,840
But for Providence's hand in my life,
I might as well have done the same.

124
00:08:27,060 --> 00:08:30,660
Sell this ring, if you may ease
your family's burden by it.

125
00:08:31,580 --> 00:08:35,540
Walk an honest path henceforth,
and I give it gladly.

126
00:08:37,840 --> 00:08:43,020
He knew he didn't owe Dario a damn
thing, and he took Dio in all the same.

127
00:08:44,300 --> 00:08:45,380
Father, hang on.

128
00:08:45,720 --> 00:08:47,520
The doctor's on his way now.

129
00:08:48,820 --> 00:08:51,580
Jojo, don't hate Dio for what he's done.

130
00:08:51,940 --> 00:08:53,820
I am to blame for this.

131
00:08:54,860 --> 00:08:58,480
I was hard on you, because
you were a Joestar.

132
00:08:59,240 --> 00:09:03,220
I went too easy on Dio, and he
might have felt I didn't care.

133
00:09:04,520 --> 00:09:07,520
Perhaps he did this for
want of a father's love.

134
00:09:09,100 --> 00:09:12,680
Please, see that he's
buried next to Dorio.

135
00:09:15,520 --> 00:09:16,350
Father...

136
00:09:19,220 --> 00:09:21,240
Don't look so sad, Jojo.

137
00:09:21,620 --> 00:09:23,140
We're better to die.

138
00:09:23,820 --> 00:09:24,917
Than in the arms...

139
00:09:25,000 --> 00:09:26,780
of my... son.

140
00:09:33,860 --> 00:09:35,060
The Joestar!

141
00:09:37,560 --> 00:09:39,660
We have lost much this night.

142
00:09:40,620 --> 00:09:42,297
A nobleman's soul...

143
00:09:42,380 --> 00:09:44,240
has been taken from the world.

144
00:09:44,800 --> 00:09:45,700
You're wrong!

145
00:09:46,080 --> 00:09:47,845
All that was good in that man!

146
00:09:47,940 --> 00:09:49,764
He passed it along to Jonathan!

147
00:09:50,060 --> 00:09:51,001
Every bit of it!

148
00:09:51,900 --> 00:09:56,860
You can be sure, Jojo's gonna live an
upright life, using what his father gave him.

149
00:09:57,620 --> 00:09:59,020
Rich folks are rubbish.

150
00:09:59,420 --> 00:10:03,477
Watching them flounce around, I want to
throw the whole lot of them into the Thames.

151
00:10:03,560 --> 00:10:05,300
But not the Joestars.

152
00:10:05,980 --> 00:10:11,040
They're heroic and merciful, and just
the whole damn lot are giants among men.

153
00:10:13,960 --> 00:10:15,080
What the hell?

154
00:10:15,420 --> 00:10:16,340
The body!

155
00:10:16,860 --> 00:10:18,217
Dio's corpse, it...

156
00:10:18,300 --> 00:10:19,480
it vanished!

157
00:10:21,240 --> 00:10:22,600
Oi, Kappa!

158
00:10:23,000 --> 00:10:24,235
Away from the window!

159
00:10:36,380 --> 00:10:37,960
Cho-cho!

160
00:10:44,900 --> 00:10:46,480
The Inspector!

161
00:10:48,000 --> 00:10:50,157
No, that's impossible!

162
00:10:50,240 --> 00:10:52,320
How is he alive? It can't be.

163
00:10:52,480 --> 00:10:54,362
We all feel him full of bullets.

164
00:10:54,980 --> 00:10:56,337
Keep your distance, lads.

165
00:10:56,420 --> 00:10:57,949
He's armed with something.

166
00:11:00,800 --> 00:11:01,940
Was it the mask?

167
00:11:04,380 --> 00:11:05,940
He's coming right at us!

168
00:11:06,080 --> 00:11:07,257
What are you waiting for?

169
00:11:07,340 --> 00:11:09,557
Hit him with everything you've got left!

170
00:11:09,640 --> 00:11:10,840
Come no closer!

171
00:11:14,780 --> 00:11:17,240
Not another step! I mean it!

172
00:11:18,480 --> 00:11:20,260
Blow his brains out now!

173
00:11:20,560 --> 00:11:22,440
Do it before he kills us all!

174
00:11:48,860 --> 00:11:49,700
Hmm... Ah!

175
00:11:51,900 --> 00:11:55,135
Shot him in the head, and it
didn't even slow him down!

176
00:11:55,260 --> 00:11:56,880
It doesn't make any sense.

177
00:11:57,140 --> 00:12:00,846
With all the lead we put in him,
he should be worm food by now.

178
00:12:01,100 --> 00:12:02,500
How can this be?

179
00:12:03,740 --> 00:12:04,570
Jojo!

180
00:12:05,400 --> 00:12:08,820
I should thank you for the
source of my newfound power,

181
00:12:09,180 --> 00:12:12,560
your father's blood, and the ancient mask!

182
00:12:19,620 --> 00:12:22,860
He takes his very life,
but how is that possible?

183
00:12:23,640 --> 00:12:24,820
Dio, you villain.

184
00:12:25,280 --> 00:12:27,456
What sort of monster have you become?

185
00:12:39,820 --> 00:12:41,280
How did this happen?

186
00:12:41,720 --> 00:12:43,060
Think, Jojo, think.

187
00:12:43,340 --> 00:12:47,040
The knife, father, blood, Dio, the mask.

188
00:12:47,240 --> 00:12:51,580
My notes, the brain, unknown
abilities, unknown strength.

189
00:12:51,980 --> 00:12:54,380
There is nothing human left of you, Dio!

190
00:13:02,440 --> 00:13:03,270
Father.

191
00:13:10,580 --> 00:13:11,980
Don't do it, Jojo!

192
00:13:12,400 --> 00:13:14,037
You haven't got a chance in hell!

193
00:13:14,120 --> 00:13:15,897
I've never seen anything like this lad.

194
00:13:15,980 --> 00:13:19,627
He broke those coppers to pieces
like they was fleeting twigs!

195
00:13:20,400 --> 00:13:21,260
I know.

196
00:13:22,780 --> 00:13:24,340
Honestly, I'm terrified.

197
00:13:24,720 --> 00:13:28,120
All the same, I can't
let Dio kill anyone else!

198
00:13:28,300 --> 00:13:30,360
This demon must be annihilated!

199
00:13:30,660 --> 00:13:32,248
Please, Jojo, I beg of you!

200
00:13:32,360 --> 00:13:33,595
He'll tear you apart!

201
00:13:34,640 --> 00:13:35,470
That's it.

202
00:13:35,700 --> 00:13:37,876
According to my research on the mask,

203
00:13:38,040 --> 00:13:41,057
it was fabled to unlock the
brain's hidden potential.

204
00:13:41,140 --> 00:13:43,900
To vanquish Dio, all I have to do is...

205
00:13:52,820 --> 00:13:54,117
This one's alive.

206
00:13:54,200 --> 00:13:55,160
Your blood.

207
00:13:56,200 --> 00:13:58,080
It smells so delicious.

208
00:14:04,900 --> 00:14:09,200
Now, I'm going to turn you inside out.

209
00:14:21,560 --> 00:14:22,880
He was my brother.

210
00:14:23,160 --> 00:14:25,040
Look at him now, father.

211
00:14:25,740 --> 00:14:28,480
Please lend me the
strength to do what I must.

212
00:14:31,380 --> 00:14:32,257
Courage, Jojo.

213
00:14:32,340 --> 00:14:35,140
Dio is powerful, but
you know how to end him.

214
00:14:35,340 --> 00:14:36,860
And end him you must!

215
00:14:37,260 --> 00:14:38,240
Watch out!

216
00:14:40,200 --> 00:14:41,030
It's over!

217
00:14:41,260 --> 00:14:44,440
I'm not going to let you
kill anyone else! Dio!

218
00:14:48,380 --> 00:14:53,740
He caught the sword and spear right
through the hand and he don't even flinch.

219
00:14:54,420 --> 00:14:55,280
No way!

220
00:14:55,520 --> 00:14:57,557
The hole from where I
shot him in the head!

221
00:14:57,640 --> 00:14:58,720
He's healed up!

222
00:14:59,020 --> 00:15:00,877
That spear ain't gonna hurt him.

223
00:15:00,960 --> 00:15:01,940
He's immortal.

224
00:15:05,600 --> 00:15:07,820
You're such a weakling, Jojo!

225
00:15:15,980 --> 00:15:18,000
On your feet, insect!

226
00:15:18,460 --> 00:15:21,780
I've yet to gauge the full
extent of my new powers,

227
00:15:22,040 --> 00:15:24,480
so let's play a little longer, shall we?

228
00:15:24,880 --> 00:15:29,100
I trust you'll be long since dead
by the time I figure them out.

229
00:15:31,900 --> 00:15:33,320
Hiding, are we?

230
00:15:48,060 --> 00:15:50,160
You were a fool to attack me.

231
00:15:50,520 --> 00:15:54,380
I have disowned my weakness
in favor of life everlasting.

232
00:15:55,560 --> 00:15:59,280
You're behind the curtain like
Polonius, and like Polonius,

233
00:15:59,380 --> 00:16:01,792
it is there that you shall meet your end.

234
00:16:06,780 --> 00:16:08,080
No one's immortal.

235
00:16:08,360 --> 00:16:09,260
Not even you.

236
00:16:17,520 --> 00:16:20,597
He's able to heal faster
than the flames can hurt him.

237
00:16:20,680 --> 00:16:23,480
If that ain't immortality,
then I'm the queen.

238
00:16:24,020 --> 00:16:26,040
Fire hurts him, but not enough.

239
00:16:33,680 --> 00:16:35,380
Jojo, what are you doing?

240
00:16:35,640 --> 00:16:37,480
Just get to safety, Speedwagon.

241
00:16:37,760 --> 00:16:40,407
If Dio wants a fight,
I mean to give him one.

242
00:16:57,760 --> 00:16:58,857
What are you doing?

243
00:16:58,940 --> 00:16:59,770
Are you mad?

244
00:16:59,860 --> 00:17:02,448
The flames are going
to box you in up there.

245
00:17:06,660 --> 00:17:08,220
Jojo, you brave fool.

246
00:17:08,480 --> 00:17:10,421
I hope to hell you've got a plan.

247
00:17:15,160 --> 00:17:16,900
I'm waiting for you, Dio.

248
00:17:25,340 --> 00:17:26,280
Know this!

249
00:17:26,540 --> 00:17:27,580
It ends here!

250
00:17:27,760 --> 00:17:30,417
I will not allow you to
leave this mansion alive!

251
00:17:30,500 --> 00:17:31,680
No! That's lunacy!

252
00:17:38,300 --> 00:17:40,560
Luring me away from the gutter, Rat.

253
00:17:40,920 --> 00:17:42,980
How very noble of you.

254
00:17:43,680 --> 00:17:44,740
No matter.

255
00:17:48,680 --> 00:17:53,386
I'll drain you dry, and your blood will
help me mend from this little adventure.

256
00:17:55,660 --> 00:17:58,177
You climb the wall in vain, Jojo.

257
00:17:58,260 --> 00:18:02,789
No, in your haste to flee from me, all
you have done is guaranteed your doom.

258
00:18:03,580 --> 00:18:07,460
You will be consumed tonight
by the inferno below or by me!

259
00:18:10,980 --> 00:18:11,810
Father.

260
00:18:17,420 --> 00:18:19,460
Father, rest in peace.

261
00:18:19,880 --> 00:18:22,680
Let the rising smoke
guide your soul to heaven.

262
00:18:24,080 --> 00:18:27,840
But first, please, lend me
your aid one final time.

263
00:18:28,440 --> 00:18:31,240
Let the fire burn with your strength.

264
00:18:34,480 --> 00:18:36,892
What does he mean to accomplish up there?

265
00:18:38,620 --> 00:18:39,900
No, that's crazy!

266
00:18:40,180 --> 00:18:41,817
You're throwing your life away!

267
00:18:41,900 --> 00:18:42,730
Don't do it!

268
00:18:42,813 --> 00:18:44,160
Don't do it, Jojo!

269
00:18:48,740 --> 00:18:50,060
Any moment now.

270
00:18:58,880 --> 00:18:59,710
Useless!

271
00:18:59,793 --> 00:19:01,838
You fight as though you want to die!

272
00:19:02,060 --> 00:19:06,020
In that moment, Jojo's short
life flashed before his eyes.

273
00:19:15,320 --> 00:19:16,780
My lonely youth!

274
00:19:17,180 --> 00:19:18,660
My time with Dio!

275
00:19:19,380 --> 00:19:23,600
You did me wrong time and again,
so now I'll settle the score!

276
00:19:24,420 --> 00:19:28,840
The longer the fire burns, the
hotter it gets, and Jojo knows it.

277
00:19:29,280 --> 00:19:32,557
He means to use the mansion
as a funeral pyre and

278
00:19:32,640 --> 00:19:35,577
burn the devil faster than
he can replenish himself.

279
00:19:35,660 --> 00:19:40,360
And now that the house is hot
enough, he's gonna knock him back in.

280
00:19:42,140 --> 00:19:42,970
Jojo!

281
00:19:47,020 --> 00:19:50,340
How dare you lay your
hands on me, you insect!

282
00:19:50,660 --> 00:19:54,366
The only home I've ever known
will be in ashes before the dawn.

283
00:19:55,080 --> 00:19:57,540
Father is dead, and I am alone.

284
00:19:58,240 --> 00:20:02,620
I have nothing left to
lose, but my life itself.

285
00:20:04,140 --> 00:20:06,540
We go to the flames together, Dio.

286
00:20:06,780 --> 00:20:10,140
I'll gladly die if it
means an end to your evil.

287
00:20:12,500 --> 00:20:14,400
Die for nothing, fool!

288
00:20:16,680 --> 00:20:20,437
All I lose by your sacrifice is
the blood I would have taken.

289
00:20:20,520 --> 00:20:24,660
Blacken and burn among the bones
of your damnable father, Jojo!

290
00:20:26,580 --> 00:20:28,840
I am a god in all but name!

291
00:20:29,020 --> 00:20:32,260
With the powers at my command,
I will rule this world!

292
00:20:32,560 --> 00:20:34,920
Thank you, brother, for this great boon!

293
00:20:47,560 --> 00:20:48,680
Damn it!

294
00:20:53,920 --> 00:20:56,140
Dio, I'm not done with you.

295
00:20:56,420 --> 00:20:58,160
Why won't you die already?

296
00:21:00,260 --> 00:21:01,500
There's no escape.

297
00:21:01,900 --> 00:21:04,760
Dio, you brought this doom upon yourself.

298
00:21:05,140 --> 00:21:07,737
This is the knife you
used to kill my father.

299
00:21:07,820 --> 00:21:12,220
So as you did to the men who
raised us both, I now do unto you.

300
00:21:21,900 --> 00:21:25,800
I've crushed his arm bones to
splinters, and he's already ablaze!

301
00:21:25,920 --> 00:21:28,449
But his grip on me is
still that of a vice!

302
00:21:29,520 --> 00:21:31,097
So be it, Jojo.

303
00:21:31,180 --> 00:21:33,300
Consign us both unto the flames!

304
00:21:33,520 --> 00:21:37,717
But perish knowing I will survive this
moment for everything you have done!

305
00:21:37,800 --> 00:21:40,360
Even this inferno cannot devour me!

306
00:21:43,260 --> 00:21:44,090
Fulmer!

307
00:21:44,173 --> 00:21:45,260
Lend me your power!

308
00:21:46,480 --> 00:21:48,817
His desperate cry echoed in the night.

309
00:21:48,900 --> 00:21:53,417
Whether urged on by his departed
father or heeding an instinct

310
00:21:53,500 --> 00:21:57,324
born of a long familiarity with
the home which burned around him,

311
00:21:57,480 --> 00:22:01,317
he kicked and that put
them right in line with

312
00:22:01,400 --> 00:22:06,777
the statue of the Joestar

313
00:22:06,860 --> 00:22:08,480
family's guardian angel.

314
00:22:12,000 --> 00:22:14,900
How could a worm like you?

315
00:22:16,900 --> 00:22:17,730
I...

316
00:22:17,813 --> 00:22:20,000
I forgot who I was dealing with!

317
00:22:20,300 --> 00:22:24,120
Bloody his nose, and he
comes back twice as fierce!

318
00:22:26,060 --> 00:22:26,890
Jojo!

319
00:22:27,840 --> 00:22:31,100
I had such plans for this world!

320
00:22:31,540 --> 00:22:33,360
Such plans!

321
00:22:40,720 --> 00:22:41,550
Jojo!

322
00:22:47,260 --> 00:22:48,800
It's over.

323
00:22:49,060 --> 00:22:50,097
You're alive.

324
00:22:50,180 --> 00:22:52,357
You lucky bastard.

325
00:22:52,440 --> 00:22:53,637
He did it.

326
00:22:53,720 --> 00:22:55,940
Jojo bested him!

327
00:23:14,900 --> 00:23:17,680
I'll spend the day your way

328
00:23:19,120 --> 00:23:23,760
Call it morning driving through
the sun and in and out the valley

329
00:23:33,560 --> 00:23:38,417
The music dance and sing They make the

330
00:23:38,500 --> 00:23:41,717
children really ring I'll

331
00:23:41,800 --> 00:23:45,760
spend the day your way

332
00:23:46,500 --> 00:23:51,020
Cold in morning, driving through
the sun And in and out the valley

333
00:23:53,080 --> 00:23:55,640
In and out around the lake

334
00:23:56,860 --> 00:24:00,780
Mountains come out of the
sky And they'll stand there

335
00:24:03,920 --> 00:24:07,460
One mile over, we'll be
there And we'll see you

336
00:24:10,260 --> 00:24:13,900
Ten true summers, we'll be
there We're laughing too

337
00:24:16,760 --> 00:24:22,260
Twenty-four, we fall by the
real sea I'll be there with you

338
00:24:40,700 --> 00:24:41,920
There it is.

339
00:25:00,960 --> 00:25:02,937
Courage is to look your fear in the eye!

340
00:25:03,020 --> 00:25:05,897
Dio's evil, yeah, but
this guy is far worse!

341
00:25:05,980 --> 00:25:07,917
Prepare for the carnage!

342
00:25:08,000 --> 00:25:09,057
Who do I look like?

343
00:25:09,140 --> 00:25:09,970
I beg of you.

344
00:25:10,160 --> 00:25:11,631
Teach me how to wield it.
